window.products.push({"id":273024,"name":"INSE Cordless Vacuum Cleaner, Stick Vacuum with 30Kpa 450W Powerful Suction, Rechargeable Battery Vacuum Up to 60mins Runtime, 6-in-1 Lightweight Vacu","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/614Ealfyp+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"INSE V120 cordless vacuum cleaner is equipped with a 150AW high-efficiency brushless digital motor and reaches a powerful suction power of up 30,000Pa at Max mode. The high-speed drive of the motor can bring a super hurricane suction which can easily suck up large particles of dog food, cat litter, and dust! The stick vacuum performs well on middle-low-pile carpets as well as hardwood floors and marble floor, tile floors, and its super suction will definitely impress you! The cordless vacuum comes with a motorized brush head with LED headlights which can swivel sideways to capture dirt under the sofa or other furniture. Cordless design is simple and elegant but also very practical. The LED light at the front of the floor brush captures and detects 99.99% of dust particles on the ground like a radar without leaving any dead spots. At the same time, the unique design of the V-shaped roller brush can easily gather the garbage sucked by the stick vacuum through the brush at high speed. Also, the metal tube that goes straight through the motor and the dust cup means that the strong suction will drive straight in without any attenuation, and the dust particles are picked up immediately meanwhile the high-efficiency HEPA filtration is working continuously. So you don’t have to worry about the secondary pollution of the exhausted gas, it's very efficient and environmentally user-friendly! Our stick vacuum cleaner very perfect on hard floors and low-pile carpets is very lightweight and weighs only 3lb, weight less than 3 bottles of 330ml Cola, which means that even your child can easily hold it up with just one hand. The lightweight vacuum is suitable for people of all ages (including those with back problems). 1L large capacity of the dustbin can fully meet your one-time cleaning need for the whole house. The rear-mounted dust cup design allows you to dump the garbage without touching or raising dust. You will have no pressure to do the cleaning after busy working days due to cleaning becoming labor-saving and worry-free! Cordless stick vacuum 4ith 7 x 2500 m-Ah large-capacity rechargeable & detachable battery pack has a long-lasting and stable battery serve life, providing up to 60 Mins long run time in a standard model, and one full charge can support the whole house cleaning at one time. There are 2 ways to charge the vacuum: separate battery charging and whole machine charging which takes 3.5~4 hours fully charged. The rear handle is embedded with a detachable battery, convenient and simple to install and remove. As one of the important replacement accessories for the V120 cordless stick vacuum cleaner, the chargeable battery can not only meet your needs of buying a spare battery but also meet the needs of charging separately. The lightweight handheld vacuum is equipped with an LED screen display that combines 2 special designs of blockage alert icons. Different from the usual icon that can only show the battery power and suction level of the vacuum, our LED screen has 2 types of blockage alert icons: dust cup blockage and floor brush blockage icons. It's very convenient to remind you in time to clean up the dust cup and the garbage blocked in the floor brush during the cleaning process, try to avoid overheating of the machine due to blockage, so as to better protect the performance of the cordless vacuum.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/614Ealfyp+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"INSE","source_asin":"B09Y5FXKGG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-273024","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09Y5FXKGG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09Y5FXKGG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
