window.products.push({"id":273094,"name":"XYJ FULL TANG Camping Knives Set Chinese Butcher Knife Vegetable Chef Knives Slice Boning Knives With Leather Knife Sleeves&Roll Bag&Kitchen Tools","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":129.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91STmNbs-rL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【XYJ Brand】Established in 1986, XYJ knives are a leading brand known for their ergonomic and mechanical lever-based design, focusing on providing superior cutting experiences. Our team of industrial designers & laboratory testers is dedicated to creating high-quality knives with exceptional sharpness, simple design, great balance, and practicality. XYJ knives are not only ideal for outdoor activities such as camping but serve as portable chef knife sets for kitchen. Choose XYJ knives for outstanding cutting performance & comfortable handling. 【XYJ Comfort Ring Design】XYJ knives offer superior cutting performance with their Comfort Ring Design. The ring design provides a comfortable, anti-slip grip for easy & enjoyable handling. It also allows for effortless cutting, reducing strain and fatigue, provides precise cutting control. Additionally, the Comfort Ring Design helps to counteract the forces generated during cutting, ensuring stability. Overall, the XYJ Comfort Ring Design combines comfort, cutting control, and stability for effortless and efficient kitchen cutting experience. 【Forged High Carbon Steel Full Tang Blade】The XYJ knife set features an ergonomic full tang design for improved stability and comfort. The handle is made from premium materials, providing durability and slip resistance for confident handling. The blade is forged using a stonewashed and hammer finish treatment, making it tough, wear-resistant, and non-sticking. Proper care is required for high carbon steel knives to prevent corrosion, but with regular maintenance, these forged knives will maintain their sharpness. 【One Set for All Tasks】This XYJ chef knife set features high carbon steel knives, including 6 various types of meat and vegetable cleaver boning knives, a 8-pockets chef knife bag, honing steel, mini whetstone, mini knife with sheath, and 3 cut-resistant finger gloves. Designed to handle a wide range of kitchen tasks, such as slicing, chopping, dicing, mincing, and cutting through tough vegetables, thick meats, cartilage, fish, fruits, and more. 【Portable Professional Chef Knife Set】All knives are neatly organized in a durable and portable chef knife bag, making it easy for you to carry for outdoor camping, hiking, and cooking, as well as convenient for use in the kitchen. Please hand wash the knives and avoid using a dishwasher. This knife set is an ideal gift choice for occasions such as Thanksgiving, weddings, birthdays, Christmas, Halloween, housewarming, and anniversaries, with its outstanding selling points.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91STmNbs-rL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"XYJ","source_asin":"B0B594STM1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-273094","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B594STM1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B594STM1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
