window.products.push({"id":273152,"name":"Newspin Twin Bed in a Bag Bedding Set - 5 Pieces Royal Blue All Season Comforter Set, Ultra Soft Bedding Comforter Set with Comforter, Flat Sheet, Fit","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":46.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711LUfNA7WL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【High Quality & Safety】: OEKO-TEX Certified, care for your sleep in a healthy and safe way. 【Ultra Soft & Lightweight】Newspin twin royal blue bed in a bag is made of high-quality microfiber, the advantages are comfort, breathability and sweat absorption. A great choice for those who are sensitive to goose down or featherbedding. The twin size royal blue comforter inner fills 240GSM microfiber to meet your various sleeping posture requirements, and always remains lightweight and fluffy 【Stylish & Durable】Do you still worry about the bedroom match? Newspin Down Alternative twin comforter is designed with delicate box stitching, simple but classic. This royal blue comforter set not only looks very decorative but also helps to evenly distribute the fiberfill and prevent shifting for maximum durability and a deluxe feel. The solid bed in a bag twin size is suitable for any room in your house as a perfect decor. 【Includes All You Need】Newspin 5pcs bed in a bag bedding set have 4 sizes available. The twin size comforter set including: Comforter: 68\" x 90\", Fitted Sheet: 39\" x 75\", Flat Sheet: 66\" x 96\", 1 Pillowcase: 20\" x 30\", 1 Pillow Sham: 20\" x 26\". Since our full comforter set comes in vacuum-sealed packaging, it is highly recommended to dry it in low heat or hang out the bedding set in the sun and gently tap it for increased fluffiness. 【Perfect For All Seasons】Newspin twin bed in a bag keeps you comfortable all year round! The 5 pieces royal blue twin comforter set is designed with breathability in mind, the appropriate filling offers good puff to keep you warm and cozy for all seasons and will let you away from sweat and keep your body fresh all night long. Our royal blue twin bed in a bag takes you warm in the winter and cooling in the summer. 【Easy Care & Satisfactory Service】Newspin royal blue alternative twin comforter set is machine washable which can save you more time and easy to keep clean. For a longer service lifespan of bed in a bag set, it is highly recommended to wash with cold water in a gentle cycle and dry in the sun or with a low-speed tumble dryer if necessary. Our comfortable comforter set brings a good sleep for you and your family!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711LUfNA7WL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Newspin","source_asin":"B0BKKZ8T37","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-273152","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BKKZ8T37","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BKKZ8T37","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":273153,"name":"MSC International Jo!e Onion Keeper, 2-Pack","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51SxHEYc8qL._AC_SL1080_.jpg","description":"Peeling onions is no small task. Between the chopping and other preparation, you’re bound to have a few tears along the way. You don’t want all those tears to be for nothing but you realize you’re only going to need about half of you onion so you need to save the rest. Using baggies to preserve the remainders is wasteful but you don’t want to take out an entire storage container for this tiny about of onion. You know it will just get mixed in with the other leftovers you don’t eat. You need a way to store it and remember to use it. Use this onion keeper, a plastic container in the shape of an onion so you don’t forget what you stored inside. When you finish chopping up the amount you need, put the rest of the onion inside and put it in the freezer to prevent it from spoiling. The container features a flat side and an onion-shaped side that slide into place for an airtight seal that keeps all the onion’s smells and flavors trapped inside.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51SxHEYc8qL._AC_SL1080_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MSC","source_asin":"B0155655B2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-273153","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0155655B2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0155655B2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
