window.products.push({"id":273376,"name":"Brouilleur Coupe, Large - Single Server Dripper","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31rV0tkeAXL._AC_.jpg","description":"This stainless steel dripper is a single server for preparing an historically correct, traditional absinthe. It is yet another way of slowly adding water (or sugar water) to your absinthe. To use, set the brouilleur (mixer in French) on top of an absinthe glass, then place water, ice and sugar inside the dripper. With three small holes in the bottom of the dripper, the sugar water slowly drips into the glass of absinthe and begins to fragrant the air with anise. Add more water/ice or sugar to taste. Remove and enjoy!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31rV0tkeAXL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bonnecaze Absinthe & Home","source_asin":"B00TAAABW8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-273376","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00TAAABW8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00TAAABW8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":273377,"name":"Artificial Topiary Tree 2-Set - Beautiful Realistic Faux Cedar Pines, 4 Feet Tall, UV Protection for Longer Life, Durable 6\" Wide Heavy Duty Pots for ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":156.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81eoHF+L8KL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Artificial Topiary Tree 2-Set   Your order includes 2 of our upgraded 4 foot faux cedar pine trees in heavy duty pots. Simply place in your yard, along your sidewalk or driveway, or anywhere you want to decorate. Makes it look like you spend hours each week doing yard work. Designed for years of outdoor beauty with no watering or trimming ever. Nobody will guess they aren't real.   Larger Heavy Duty Pots   Our pots are the larger 6\" size made of heavier material that won't tip, crack, or break. Place the trees indoors or outdoors in the pots these come in, or place the pot and tree inside one of your fancy stone pots or wooden planter. It's the instant solution that always earns compliments.   Durable UV Protection   Made of high grade plastic that can easily withstand sun, heat, cold, rain, and snow. These normally last and look good for a long 3 to 5 years depending on your local weather. Just think of all the time and effort you will save with these artificial trees you don't have to care for. It's modern convenience that gives you the luxurious look you want.   Packed in Sturdy Box   We pack your 2 trees carefully and compactly in a stronger, upgraded box. The tougher box and heavy duty pot ensure your trees arrive without damage. Allow a day or two for branches to fully expand. Please contact us immediately if you see damage. We will offer a prompt no-cost solution.   Now Shipping   We have trees in fresh production ready to ship direct to your door. Enjoy the finest in the industry not available in box stores. Many customers are so pleased with the attractive look and higher quality, they return to buy several more to fully decorate their property. This makes a much appreciated gift for friends, family, and co-workers who like no maintenance greenery.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81eoHF+L8KL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AUMMOOH","source_asin":"B0BVLFCMJZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-273377","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BVLFCMJZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BVLFCMJZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
