window.products.push({"id":273724,"name":"NOVICA 230244 Blow Glass, 6 Count (Pack of 1), Blue","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":75.21,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YLZhUrV7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"\"NOVICA, in association with National Geographic, works together with talented artisan designers around the world to produce stunning, keepsake treasures. Our mantra is to spread global happiness, so rest assured - we’ll do everything we possibly can to ensure you’re a happy customer. About this item: These handcrafted beer glasses with cobalt blue handle and rim are designed and crafted by Javier and Efrén. They deliver an artistic touch to a favorite brew. Each glass has individual authenticity resulting from the handcrafted blown glass process through which they are created. Because each piece is handmade, shape and size can vary slightly and tiny bubbles may appear within the glass. This exemplifies the hand-blown technique, making every piece a unique example of blown glass craftsmanship. - Free of lead and toxins - This hand blown item may vary slightly in color, size and shape - Dishwasher: use top rack only. Hand wash recommended. About our Artist: 'This type of work is a beautiful craft. I love blown glass because of the pure imagination poured into every piece created,\" confides Efren. Working as a team, Javier specializes in the design of the pieces, and Efren transforms the designs into a reality. 'Efren and I make a great team. Over the years we have worked hard to design truly original styles with a distinctly Mexican accent,' says Javier.\"","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YLZhUrV7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NOVICA","source_asin":"B00OMFKHTI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-273724","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00OMFKHTI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00OMFKHTI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
