window.products.push({"id":273732,"name":"Dainty Home Complete Waffle Shower Curtain with Detachable Liner, 70\" x 72\", Silver Grey","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91tmNG9H53L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Transform any bathroom décor with this premium quality waffle weave fabric shower curtain with snap on liner by Dainty Home. The 2 in 1 shower curtain collection offers a beautiful woven waffle weave fabric curtain with a easy to use detachable fabric liner. These luxurious high-end hotel-inspired waffle-weave shower curtains offer the perfect combination of fashion, function and design for the home. Constructed from heavy-weight fabric to ensure durability and long lasting style, Hotel Collection shower curtains feature a visually pleasing, woven texture that makes you feel like you’re on vacation at a tropical resort in your own home. The beautiful waffle weave fabric transforms an ordinary bathroom into a spa-like retreat. Soft to the touch, waffle weave shower curtains take your bathroom décor to a whole new level of design and comfort. Dainty Home shower curtains offer style and decorating solutions for all bathrooms. Solid color waffle weave shower curtains are unisex and perfect for kids or adult bathrooms. Also comes in a blue floral and decorative swirl design. Hang the Complete Waffle Weave Shower Curtain with built-in liner in every bathroom in your home – perfect for any bathtub, stand up shower stall or free standing claw foot bathtub with a standard size curtain rod. Add 2 in 1 shower curtains by Dainty home to coordinate with your bathroom towels, bath rugs and wall décor without worry. Polyester fabric shower curtains are naturally water repellant, and maintain their beauty with limited washing. This solid color waffle weave shower curtain collection brings an eye-catching, signature look to any bathroom in the house, apartment, dorm and more. You are sure to impress your friends, family and guests by hanging these lovely shower curtains for a stylish update to your bathroom. Hang this ultimate bathroom solution shower curtain when you update your shower-heads and shower doors – to ensure a complete updated look. The waffle weave, honeycomb texture shower curtain with liner can be used indoor or outdoor. Reinforced holes and plastic snaps make it the perfect solution for your outdoor shower after using the pool or a day at the beach. Available in an array of colors, this style friendly shower curtain compliments any bathroom style and décor. Shower curtain measures 70 inches wide x 72 inches long and fits curtain hooks and liners not included. Easy care machine wash cold, gentle dry cool – do not bleach. Imported Key Features of Dainty Home Complete 2 in 1 Shower Curtain with Liner Collection: Total shower curtain panel with Liner Size: 70 inches wide x 72 inches long (size might vary slightly). Weave: Textured Waffle Weave with Honeycomb Pattern. Pattern: Often used in luxury robes and towels, the waffle pattern creates a textured design on the fabric that looks like a honeycomb in nature. The waffle weave also allows air to flow through the fabric for quick drying. The surface texture looks like a culinary waffle, hence the name. Style: Luxury hotel-inspired style and design. Fabric: 100% Polyester is naturally and water - quick drying. Waterproof: Shower curtain with combo liner is waterproof Construction: Machine woven polyester curtain and liner - curtain has a waffle weave texture. Origin: China. Care Instructions for Curtain & Liner: Easy care machine wash in cold water as needed, tumble dry low on cool, do not bleach. Use Recommendations: Hang in any bathroom with a standard or curved shower curtain rod. Can also hang using shower curtain tension rod. Hooks, rings and rod sold separately. Do I need a Shower Curtain Liner? No, this shower curtain has an easy snap on/snap off liner attached to it that is also machine washable. Ok for Outdoor Use? Yes all materials able to dry quickly. Toss entire shower curtain with liner in the wash as needed.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91tmNG9H53L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dainty Home","source_asin":"B0C4BV12FX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-273732","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C4BV12FX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C4BV12FX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
