window.products.push({"id":273788,"name":"up & up & UP Moon Shelf for Cryals - with LED Lights and ars. Cryal Shelf Display, Moon Wall Shelf, Moon Display Shelves for Essential Oils. Wooden Mo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91aDbg0HdsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Perfect Gift ! Make a beautiful impression in your home. Looks good on the outside - will make you feel great on the inside Delightful to look at and hold. Distinctive. Classic. And Classy. 🌙Brand New for 2021! 🌙Unique Design! 🌙A beautiful, handmade Moon and Star Floating Home Decor Moon Shelf unit. 🌙Complete with LED lights on the back to create a magical night time glow. 🌙Quality craftsmanship made from Pine Wood. 🌙This floating shelf has beautiful stars and moons cut out. 🌙This is a gorgeous addition to any home, room, bathroom or living room. 🌙Comes pre-assembled and ready to hang. 🌙Lightweight, yet solid and durable. 🌙Stores knick-knacks, crystals, bathroom accessories, small toys, make-up, plants etc. 🌙2 batteries included. The LED lights will warm any area and bath your wall with a calm energy. SIZE: 34cm x 34cm x 8 cm (13 inches x 13 inches x 3 inches) PLEASE NOTE: Batteries ARE included! This moon shelf gives off a beautiful glow at night.Simply insert the 2 lithium batteries included. ======== How To Insert The Batteries. This Moon Shelf comes with 2 small, round lithium batteries. Inserting the batteries is a straightforward process. Simply open the plastic unit on the back of the unit and insert the 2 lithium batteries. IMPORTANT: The batteries have a flat side which is the positive side (the positive side has a + on it) The other side of the battery is rounded and has nothing on it, this is the negative side. The batteries need to be inserted with one battery facing up and the other facing down. If after inserting the batteries the lights do not work, simply switch the batteries to face in the opposite direction and the lights will work.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91aDbg0HdsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"up & up & UP","source_asin":"B08XY94V6V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-273788","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08XY94V6V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08XY94V6V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
