window.products.push({"id":273833,"name":"Lobyn Value Packs 2 Piece Pot Holders for Kitchen Heat Resistant 100% Heavy Weight Cotton Pot Holders Hot Pads for Kitchen Two Red 6\" X 9\" Potholders ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61D5okCCCGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"As any cook knows, the kitchen can be a hazardous place. Between the oven, stove, and microwave, there are plenty of opportunities for burns. That's why it's essential to have good pot holders on hand. These pot holders are made from high-quality materials that will resist heat and protect your hands from burns. They're also perfect for use as hot pads. Whether you're using them to protect your countertops from hot pans or you're using them to grab something out of the oven, these pot holders will help you stay safe in the kitchen. So don't wait any longer, order your set of two pot holders today.  Our oblong potholders are the perfect size for large pots and pans. Measuring 6 inches by 9 inches, they provide ample coverage to protect your hands from hot surfaces. These thick hot pads are also nearly a half-inch thick, providing greater insulation and heat protection than thinner potholders. Whether you're cooking a big meal for a crowd or simply want an extra-large hot pad for your favorite cast iron skillet, our oblong potholders are up to the task. Made from durable cotton fabric, they're machine-washable for easy care. Choose from a variety of colors to coordinate with your kitchen décor. Add a set of our oblong potholders to your cart today! The kitchen is the heart of the home, and anyone who has spent time in a kitchen knows that hot pans and cookie sheets are a part of life. That's why potholders are such an essential item in any kitchen. Not only do they protect your hands from heat, but they also help to prevent accidental burns. Potholders come in all shapes and sizes, but the heavy quilted potholders are the ones that really stand up to the heat. These potholders are made of thick fabric with a layer of padding in between, and they're able to withstand temperatures up to 500 degrees. So whether you're taking a pan out of the oven or putting a pot on the stove, these potholders will help to keep you safe.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61D5okCCCGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lobyn Value Packs","source_asin":"B09DS3QHKP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-273833","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09DS3QHKP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09DS3QHKP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
