window.products.push({"id":273848,"name":"MK-5022 Damascus Chef Knife/Kitchen knife Set of 5 Pieces Professional Japanese Style BBQ Knife Set Custom Handmade Carbon Steel with Red and Brown Pa","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":59.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/912FdCI3Y+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Package includes: Chef Knife (Total Length: 345mm) Sculpture knife (Total Length: 315mm) Carving Knife (Total Length: 310mm) Cleaver knife (Total Length: 295mm) Knife Sharpener (Total Length: 390mm) Leather Cover CHEFKNIVES: This knife is typically 8 to 10 inches long with rounded blade tip. The chef's knife is one of the most useful knives. It will feel like an extension of the arm. It is essential for cutting and chopping vegetables, fruits and herbs. Also, to cut a variety of other ingredients such as meat, chicken, and fish. SCULPTURE KNIVES: After cooking a large piece of meat, such as beef and a steak, a sculpture knife will be very helpful. They are rrower for precision and can be longer to cut larger pieces. CARVING KNIVES: Like chef knives, carving knives have long, thin blades with a round or pointed tip. With a more flexible blade than a chef knife, they are used to cut thinner slices of roast, fruits, and vegetables. CLEAVER (Butcher Knife): The blade, also known as a butcher knife, is a thick, heavy knife with a sharp edge. It is most often found in butcher shops and restaurants that prepare their own meat. This knife is used to separate the meat from the bone that is typically used for beef, chicken, and other types of thick meat. KNIFE SHARPENER: Knife sharpening is the process of making a knife-sharp by grinding it against a hard, rough surface. So, no need to worry about this as we also offer premium quality Knife sharpener that you will be needing before using the knives in the knife set, it is round in shape with a handle to hold.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/912FdCI3Y+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Markhor knives","source_asin":"B091HQVF82","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-273848","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B091HQVF82","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B091HQVF82","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
