window.products.push({"id":273993,"name":"Kotton Culture Kitchen Napkins for Kitchen, Cooking,Christmas, Thanksgiving, Baking BBQ – 100% Cotton Dish Cloths with Hanging Loop Kotton Culture 4 P","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.19,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/912BVO4m1jL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"DURABLE COTTON FABRIC: Made from 100% cotton, these Kotton Culture kitchen napkins are absorbent for wiping up splatters, drying dishes, sopping up spills, and wiping countertops. They’re also lint-free for drying and cleaning your dishes and glassware. It doesn't wear or tear easily and features a strong stitching to avoid fraying and loose ends, while its bright prints are fade-resistant, giving you many years of use. FUNCTIONAL AND CONVENIENT: Add a touch of print to your backyard barbecue or complete an elegant table setting for your next dinner party, this napkin set is the perfect choice. While not being used, these multi-purpose kitchen napkins can be displayed in your kitchen or on your appliances as decorative kitchen accessories. UNIQUE DESIGN WITH LOOP: Refresh your kitchen décor with these stylish kitchen napkins. These vibrant napkins feature a bright lemon print design to bring a refreshing look to your home kitchen or dining room. The set includes 4 kitchen napkins with an 8 cm plain green edge at the bottom edge. PAIR WITH MATCHING KITCHEN LINEN: Use these kitchen napkins on their own or pair them with our other kitchen linen items like matching kitchen potholders, towels, mittens, table mats, aprons, and tablecloths. Our Easter Collection incorporates all kitchen textiles a baker, chef, or host may need for their kitchen. Click the Kotton Culture store link at the top of the page to explore our functional, stylish, and affordable home accessories. EASY CARE & MAINTENANCE: Kotton Culture kitchen napkins are machine washable for easy clean-up and everyday use. When the napkins need a refresh, we recommend you spot clean it by hand, rinse off with water and wipe clean. When it comes time for a pick-me-up, just toss them in the washing machine and wash warm with like colors. Do not bleach.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/912BVO4m1jL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kotton Culture","source_asin":"B0BYVTQW6V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-273993","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BYVTQW6V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BYVTQW6V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
